graph TD
    A[Start DsotCore init] --> B{Debug mode enabled?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Initialize Trace Logger to temp directory]
    B -- No --> D[Skip early logger]
    
    C --> E[Load Config via dsot_config]
    D --> E
    
    E --> F{Debug mode enabled?}
    
    F -- No --> G[Initialize final Logger from Config]
    F -- Yes --> H[Skip final logger redirection]
    
    G --> I[Discover/Login local User Profile]
    H --> I
    
    I --> J[Initialize DsotRepository]
    J --> K[Hydrate UI DsotState]
    K --> L[Start DsotNetwork]
    L --> M[Yield hydrated DsotCore]
